{"id":"75cba0fd-bd75-42c0-a65d-1f118116ceae","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:05:56.884Z","batchId":"onboarding_nemotron-3-5-lightning-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"nemotron-3.5-lightning-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <h1 class=\"lead\">Welcome</h1>\n  <p class=\"muted\">We'll walk you through three simple steps to get started.</p>\n\n  <!-- Step progress -->\n  <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Step</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-value\">1 of 3</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Step navigation -->\n  <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"col-3 badge badge-outline\">Account</div>\n    <div class=\"col-3 badge badge-outline\">Preferences</div>\n    <div class=\"col-3 badge badge-outline\">Done</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Wizard steps -->\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <!-- Step 1: Account -->\n    <div class=\"card\" data-step=\"1\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Account</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">Tell us who you are.</div>\n      <form>\n        <label>Full name\n          <input type=\"text\" required>\n        </label>\n        <label>Email address\n          <input type=\"email\" required>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" required>\n          I’ve read and agree to the Terms & Conditions\n        </label>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block\">Continue</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 2: Preferences -->\n    <div class=\"card\" data-step=\"2\" style=\"display:none;\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Preferences</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">Choose how you’d like to receive updates.</div>\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"light\" checked> Light\n      </label>\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"dark\"> Dark\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\"> Subscribe to newsletter\n      </label>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block\">Continue</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 3: Done -->\n    <div class=\"card\" data-step=\"3\" style=\"display:none;\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Done</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\">You’re all set!</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">Onboarding complete</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">100%</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-block\">Finish</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Navigation -->\n  <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"btn-back\">Back</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"btn-next\">Next</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const steps = document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]');\n  let current = 1;\n  const progress = document.querySelector('.stat-value');\n  function showStep(n) {\n    steps.forEach(s => s.style.display = 'none');\n    document.querySelector(`[data-step=\"${n}\"]`).style.display = 'block';\n    progress.textContent = `${n} of 3`;\n    document.getElementById('btn-back').disabled = n === 1;\n    document.getElementById('btn-next').textContent = n === 3 ? 'Finish' : 'Next';\n  }\n  showStep(1);\n  document.getElementById('btn-next').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (current < 3) { current++; showStep(current); }\n  });\n  document.getElementById('btn-back').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (current > 1) { current--; showStep(current); }\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[23314,"<div"],[23319," class"],[23319,"=\""],[23319,"page"],[23319,"\">\n"],[23322," "],[23333," "],[23333,"<h"],[23333,"1"],[23334," class"],[23334,"=\""],[23334,"lead"],[23334,"\">"],[23334,"Welcome"],[23338,"</h"],[23338,"1"],[23338,">\n"],[23344," "],[23344," "],[23344,"<p"],[23344," class"],[23353,"=\""],[23353,"m"],[23353,"uted"],[23353,"\">"],[23356,"We"],[23356,"'ll"],[23356," walk"],[23356," you"],[23360," through"],[23360," three"],[23360," simple"],[23360," steps"],[23380," to"],[23380," get"],[23380," started"],[23380,"."],[23380,"</p"],[23380,">\n\n"],[23380," "],[23380," <!--"],[23380," Step"],[23380," progress"],[23386," -->\n"],[23386," "],[23386," "],[23386,"<div"],[23390," class"],[23390,"=\""],[23390,"row"],[23390," between"],[23402," center"],[23402," gap"],[23402,"-sm"],[23402,"\">\n"],[23402,"   "],[23410," "],[23410,"<div"],[23410," class"],[23410,"=\""],[23412,"stat"],[23412,"-label"],[23412,"\">"],[23412,"Step"],[23419,"</div"],[23419,">\n"],[23419,"   "],[23424," "],[23424,"<div"],[23424," class"],[23424,"=\""],[23434,"stat"],[23434,"-value"],[23434,"\">"],[23434,"1"],[23436," of"],[23437," "],[23437,"3"],[23440,"</div"],[23440,">\n"],[23440," "],[23454," "],[23454,"</div"],[23454,">\n\n"],[23454," "],[23454," <!--"],[23454," Step"],[23454," navigation"],[23454," -->\n"],[23458," "],[23459," "],[23459,"<div"],[23459," class"],[23465,"=\""],[23465,"row"],[23465," between"],[23465," center"],[23475," gap"],[23475,"-sm"],[23475,"\">\n"],[23475,"   "],[23476," "],[23476,"<div"],[23476," class"],[23476,"=\""],[23487,"col"],[23487,"-"],[23487,"3"],[23487," badge"],[23487," badge"],[23487,"-outline"],[23487,"\">"],[23487,"Account"],[23505,"</div"],[23505,">\n"],[23505,"   "],[23505," "],[23505,"<div"],[23505," class"],[23505,"=\""],[23512,"col"],[23512,"-"],[23512,"3"],[23512," badge"],[23513," badge"],[23513,"-outline"],[2